WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:10.840 --> 00:00:14.120
When I was a child, 
my brother would tell me a bed time story

00:00:14.260 --> 00:00:16.480
about the man who murdered our father.

00:00:17.380 --> 00:00:20.080
About all the things we would do to that man.

00:00:22.520 --> 00:00:24.220
You never should have trusted Cersei.

00:00:24.480 --> 00:00:26.020
You never should have either.

00:00:27.020 --> 00:00:28.720
Death...

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:33.313
It's got many faces. 
I look forward to seeing this one.

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:34.980
How long do we have?

00:00:39.680 --> 00:00:41.680
Before the sun comes up tomorrow.

